<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 38, background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模块一 · LLM 运行时与降级（张瑞桐）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#06B6D4', marginLeft: 12, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>稳定性不绑死任一模型</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '47%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #06B6D4' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位：LLM 只是<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>可换、可关、可降级</span>的「增强件」。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Provider 运行时</span>：Ollama(本地 qwen2.5:3b) ↔ 通义千问(qwen-plus)，.env 的 AI_PROVIDER 切换。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>非阻塞调用</span>：线程池 + 并发信号量 + 超时兜底，失败/超时自动降级规则引擎，不阻塞事件循环。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>ENABLE_LLM_NARRATIVE=False</span> → 纯规则叙事，零幻觉。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 双通道 try_ollama_generate / _cloud_generate_impl；ollama_status 引擎健康检查。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '53%', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <svg width='540' height='360' viewBox='0 0 540 360'>
        <defs>
          <marker id='ar12' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='7' refY='3' orient='auto'>
            <path d='M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' />
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <rect x='30' y='30' width='210' height='56' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='135' y='54' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>Ollama 本地</text>
        <text x='135' y='74' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>qwen2.5:3b</text>
        <rect x='300' y='30' width='210' height='56' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='405' y='54' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>通义千问 云端</text>
        <text x='405' y='74' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>qwen-plus</text>
        <text x='270' y='20' textAnchor='middle' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='13'>AI_PROVIDER 切换</text>
        <rect x='40' y='180' width='460' height='56' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='204' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>规则引擎 · 唯一事实源</text>
        <text x='270' y='224' textAnchor='middle' fill='#C4B5FD' fontSize='12'>降级 / 零幻觉兜底 · 永远在线</text>
        <rect x='170' y='290' width='200' height='54' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='314' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>输出：等级/分数/解释</text>
        <text x='270' y='334' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>解释缺失则回退规则文案</text>
        <line x1='135' y1='86' x2='220' y2='180' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar12)' />
        <line x1='405' y1='86' x2='320' y2='180' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar12)' />
        <line x1='250' y1='236' x2='250' y2='290' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar12)' />
        <line x1='290' y1='236' x2='290' y2='290' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='5,4' />
      </svg>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 18px', background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6,182,212,0.16), rgba(139,92,246,0.05))', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.35)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>答辩亮点</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模型可换、可关、可降级——再强的模型出问题，最终结论仍由规则兜底，服务不中断。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>实战避错系统 · 团队分工</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>12 / 25</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
